 ｜系列：Harvard Data Science Industry Lecture Series\n\n摘要：Produ
 ction AI systems need four properties that no benchmark reports: debuggabi
 lity\, control\, consistency\, and generalization. This talk argues that n
 one of the four can be optimized into existence\, and that they must be bu
 ilt in at design time. The argument starts by sorting AI deployments along
  two axes: the cost of a mistake and the cost of verification. Where verif
 ication is cheap\, as in codi…\n\n活动页：https://events.seas.harvar
 d.edu/event/the-missing-discipline-of-production-ai\n\n来源：harvard_se
